IMAPAccount namecheap
Host mail.privateemail.com
Port 993
User @EMAIL@
PassCmd "nixx credentials show email_password"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore namecheap-remote
Account namecheap

MaildirStore namecheap-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path /data/mail/namecheap/
Inbox /data/mail/namecheap/INBOX

Channel namecheap
Far :namecheap-remote:
Near :namecheap-local:
Patterns * !Spam
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
